LOCATION:North Hall 2111
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Sephorah Mangin \, Australian National University\nH
 osted by: Peter Rupert\n\nSephorah Mangin is an Associate Professor in E
 conomics. Her research interests include macroeconomics\, search theory\
 , labour economics\, economic growth\, and industrial organisation. She 
 has conducted research at the Becker Friedman Institute at the Universit
 y of Chicago\, and is an Associate Editor at the European Economic Revie
 w . Sephorah has published her research in a number of prestigious peer-
 reviewed journals including the Journal of Economic Theory\, the Journal
  of Monetary Economics\, the RAND Journal of Economics \, and Econometri
 ca .\n\nhttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2026/macro-seminar-sephorah-man
 gin-australian-national-university
URL:https://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2026/macro-seminar-sephorah-mangin-a
 ustralian-national-university
