SUMMARY:CARE Seminar: Yana Gallen \, University of Chicago
LOCATION:North Hall 2111
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Yana Gallen \, University of Chicago\nHosted by: Hea
 ther Royer\n\nI am a labor economist studying why gender gaps in earning
 s persist despite decades of progress in women's education and labor for
 ce participation. My research highlights parenthood as a central source 
 of these gaps. I study how children shape women's careers before and aft
 er birth\, including how pregnancy timing\, workplace flexibility\, chil
 dcare\, and career advice affect earnings\, employment\, and career prog
 ression.\n\nhttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2027/care-seminar-yana-gall
 en-university-chicago
URL:https://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2027/care-seminar-yana-gallen-univer
 sity-chicago
