DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Rebekah Dix \, Stanford\nHosted by: David Silver\n\n
 I am a postdoctoral fellow at the Stanford Institute for Economic Policy
  Research (2026–27). I will join Stanford University as an Assistant P
 rofessor of Economics in July 2027. My primary research field is industr
 ial organization\, including work on innovation and health. I received a
  BA from the University of Wisconsin–Madison in 2019\, a PhD in econom
 ics from MIT in 2025\, and was previously a postdoctoral fellow at the C
 owles Foundation at Yale University.\n\nhttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all
 /2027/care-seminar-rebekah-dix-stanford
