SUMMARY:CARE Seminar: Audrey Guo \, Santa Clara University
LOCATION:North Hall 2111
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Audrey Guo \, Santa Clara University\nHosted by: You
 ssef Benzarti\n\nMy research interests include Public\, Labor\, and Heal
 th economics\, with a focus on social insurance and firm responses to ta
 xation. I received my PhD in Economics from Stanford University\, and jo
 ined Santa Clara University as an Assistant Professor of Economics in Fa
 ll 2019.\n\nhttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2027/care-seminar-audrey-gu
 o-santa-clara-university
